-- akn:attachments/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p3 The wages commissioner; no rule.
-- akn:attachments/p4 A fax banner; no rule.

-- The letter: the grant is not a component counted in the erosion checks.
@ref akn:att_1__hc_1/p7
`the long-day grant is counted in the erosion checks` MEANS FALSE

§§ `examples`

-- Eight hours outside the reform, all year: 6,300; four hours under it:
-- 2,350; employed half the year: half; a teacher outside the reform whose
-- hours outside the long day are fewer than his hours in it is owed none.
#ASSERT `the long-day grant he is owed` `the full long day outside the reform` 1 0 `illness in the long-day year` EQUALS 6300
#ASSERT `the long-day grant he is owed` `the full long day outside the reform` 0.5 0 `illness in the long-day year` EQUALS 3150
`four hours under the reform` MEANS
    `a teacher's long day` WITH
        `under the reform's terms`                       IS TRUE
        `assigned with his consent`                      IS FALSE
        `required by his timetable to teach in the seventh and eighth hours` IS TRUE
        `weekly frontal hours in the long day`           IS 4
        `weekly hours outside the long day`              IS 20

`eight hours outside the reform, with six outside the long day` MEANS
    `a teacher's long day` WITH
        `under the reform's terms`                       IS FALSE
        `assigned with his consent`                      IS TRUE
        `required by his timetable to teach in the seventh and eighth hours` IS FALSE
        `weekly frontal hours in the long day`           IS 8
        `weekly hours outside the long day`              IS 6

#ASSERT `the long-day grant he is owed` `four hours under the reform` 1 0 `illness in the long-day year` EQUALS 2350
#ASSERT NOT `owed the long-day grant` `eight hours outside the reform, with six outside the long day`
#ASSERT `the share of the long-day grant paid with May's salary` PLUS `the share of the long-day grant paid with June's salary` EQUALS 1
